1
00:00:00,710 --> 00:00:02,620
(Wil:)I was trying to save your life.

2
00:00:02,779 --> 00:00:05,729
(Penny:)Life? What life?
Look at me! I'm a monster!

3
00:00:05,882 --> 00:00:09,852
(Penny:)And now I have blood on my hands,
or paws. I don't know.

4
00:00:12,789 --> 00:00:15,899
(Wil:)You can't give up.
I love you.

5
00:00:18,829 --> 00:00:20,039
(Penny:)I love you too.

6
00:00:20,197 --> 00:00:23,077
(Penny:)But I'm afraid I love killing more.

7
00:00:23,233 --> 00:00:25,573
(Penny:)Like, one day,
I might actually try and kill you!

8
00:00:28,538 --> 00:00:30,748
(Director:)And... cut.
All right.

9
00:00:34,477 --> 00:00:36,047
(Raj:)All right,
let's set up for the next scene.

10
00:00:36,213 --> 00:00:38,383
Actually, know what?
Can we do one more?

11
00:00:39,549 --> 00:00:40,719
(Penny:)I think I could do it better.

12
00:00:40,884 --> 00:00:42,864
(Director:)Let's just move on.
No one cares.

13
00:00:43,053 --> 00:00:45,363
(Penny:)Well, I care.
I mean, look, if we're gonna do this,

14
00:00:45,488 --> 00:00:48,368
(Penny:)why not try and make it
something we're actually proud of?

15
00:00:51,428 --> 00:00:54,998
(Director:)Look, sweetie, this movie is garbage,
but you should be happy about that,

16
00:00:55,165 --> 00:00:57,735
(Director:)'cause if it was a good movie,
you wouldn't be in it.

17
00:00:59,536 --> 00:01:01,676
(Leonard:)Whoa, whoa, hang on.
There's no need to insult her.

